<title>UK: SEK sets 110 million stg bond due July 1999.</title>
<headline>SEK sets 110 million stg bond due July 1999.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers IBJ International and Wako International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH EXPORT CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    110 MLN STG   COUPON     6.60	MATURITY    27.JUL.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    27.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
